 "strings": [
  "",
  "Even after a man-made disaster",
  "that had everyone fearing",
  "the Earth itself would break,",
  "the foolish war went on.",
  "Even so,",
  "the wind shifted a little.",
  "People are foolish,",
  "but not only foolish.",
  "The ruin of the Earth, plain",
  "to see even from space,",
  "shook even pro-Zeon",
  "space dwellers.",
  "Not a few citizens",
  "of the Principality of Zeon,",
  "amid a nationwide campaign",
  "trumpeting a glorious victory,",
  "were horrified at their own deeds.",
  "Fear became murmurs,",
  "and murmurs",
  "became political pressure.",
  "The Principality of Zeon, after all,",
  "had a parliament and a premier.",
  "Even Sovereign Degwin",
  "softened toward conciliation.",
  "And so, chiefly",
  "for political reasons, any further",
  "use of a colony,",
  "or an asteroid or the like,",
  "as a mass weapon",
  "was abandoned.",
  "Later, as if to ratify this,",
  "the Federation and Zeon signed",
  "the Antarctic Treaty, a law of war,",
  "but it meant next to nothing",
  "beyond prisoner exchanges.",
  "Nuclear arms and the like, besides",
  "mass weapons, were banned too,",
  "but that was likely incidental.",
  "From then on, the political climate",
  "would allow no weapon",
  "of mass destruction.",
  "Zeon only wanted independence;",
  "the Earth Federation just said no.",
  "Each side confirmed that fact,",
  "and accepted killing one another",
  "with lives at stake, but never",
  "did it become a war of annihilation.",
  "Some call this",
  "hypocrisy, and some ask",
  "whether they need have fought",
  "at all, but",
  "this work would put it so:",
  "that people, if not as much as",
  "in later ages,",
  "disliked killing at least as much",
  "as they ever had.",
  "And the stage of battle",
  "shifted to the ground.",
  "It was the prelude to Zeon's ruin.",
  "Why a Ground War?",
  "Mobile Suits on the Ground",
  "To begin with,",
  "Zeon's invasion of Earth",
  "was set off",
  "by the colony drop.",
  "The colony drop and the fighting",
  "before and after it cost mankind",
  "nearly half its population,",
  "and not the Earth Federation but",
  "the people living on Earth",
  "were the ones it embittered.",
  "Even then, the Earth Federation",
  "had many residents opposing it",
  "as corrupt, but",
  "the colony drop",
  "became the trigger,",
  "and they swung as one behind",
  "the Earth Federation.",
  "No forgiveness for Zeon.",
  "This swelled into a great surge",
  "that ended up uniting",
  "the Earth Federation as one.",
  "One sees this clearly",
  "in the mobilization figures.",
  "With double its former vigor,",
  "the Federation built new weapons",
  "and hardened its stance.",
  "Zeon, meanwhile,",
  "found mass destruction weapons",
  "hard to use, and in the end,",
  "spurred too by its run",
  "of crushing victories so far,",
  "it came to send troops",
  "down to the Earth.",
  "Zeon, a nation of space dwellers,",
  "going to war on the ground,",
  "brought curious weapons",
  "down to Earth in great numbers.",
  "Every one of these",
  "worked well inside a colony,",
  "but",
  "on Earth, problems piled up.",
  "Some only resembled",
  "Earth weapons on the outside,",
  "but were in fact something",
  "else entirely.",
  "Just as the Earth Federation,",
  "new to space, struggled there,",
  "on Earth Zeon struggled in turn,",
  "in an unfamiliar environment.",
  "Indeed, many soldiers raised",
  "an uproar at the mere sight",
  "of insects or blowing sand.",
  "In such conditions,",
  "what did comparatively well",
  "was the mobile suit.",
  "Zeon itself had begun",
  "using mobile suits because they",
  "could wield big guns and move",
  "on their own, but",
  "they proved better than hoped",
  "and led Zeon's ground forces.",
  "Not only firing from the rear,",
  "but armored up for the front line.",
  "Were it only about performance,",
  "a Zaku machine gun mounted",
  "on a tank chassis",
  "should have done better,",
  "and that this never happened",
  "was likely because Zeon knew",
  "so little of ground tactics.",
  "Also, rather than building",
  "a range of specialized vehicles,",
  "building one mobile suit",
  "and nothing else",
  "suited Zeon, whose manpower",
  "was so scarce compared to",
  "the Federation's.",
  "Either way, Zeon",
  "would begin fighting on the ground.",
  "And before them stood",
  "countless people of Earth,",
  "burning for revenge...",
  "On the ground, Zeon struggled.",
  "Earthlings were strong on Earth.",
  "Zeon,",
  "with no real answer,",
  "let the fight sink",
  "into a quagmire."
